{%- comment -%}
  The free-sample wax seal, on a product card in a grid.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} the product being sampled

  It lives on the card only. The product page does not carry one: by the
  time the reader is there the offer is already stated under the buy box,
  and a seal over the photograph would be selling something they have
  already found.
{%- endcomment -%}
<a class="sample-sticker" href="{{ product.url }}#sample">
  <span class="sample-sticker__kicker">{{ settings.sample_sticker_kicker | default: 'Free sample' }}</span>
  <span class="sample-sticker__line">{{ settings.sample_sticker_label | default: 'Smell It First' }}</span>
</a>
